{
  "info": {
    "name": "Dokkai API",
    "_postman_id": "d0kka1-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
    "description": "HTTP API for Dokkai — a graph-aware vector database over a codebase.\n\nUsage order:\n1. Config → Set LLM provider (or set OLLAMA_CHAT_MODEL on the server).\n2. Instances → Start pipeline (captures {{jobId}} automatically).\n3. Instances → Get job (poll until status = succeeded), or Job events (SSE) to stream progress.\n4. Chat → Chat (SSE): note Postman shows the raw event stream.\n5. Graph → List graphs / Get project graph / Get entity neighborhood / Get file dependency view, once a project is ingested.\n\nNote: only one pipeline/refresh job may run per project at a time — a second one returns 409 (see the '409 - job already running' saved examples).\n\nCollection variables let you avoid editing every request: set {{baseUrl}}, {{repoPath}}, {{projectName}} once.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8000", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "repoPath", "value": "/absolute/path/to/your/repo", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "projectName", "value": "your-repo", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "jobId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "conversationId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "entityQualifiedName", "value": "src.alarms.AlarmValidationUseCase", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Health",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Root (health check)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": [""] },
            "description": "Returns {\"status\":\"online\"} when the API is up."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Instances",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Start pipeline",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (res.job_id) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('jobId', res.job_id);",
                  "  console.log('Saved jobId =', res.job_id);",
                  "}",
                  "pm.test('job queued', function () {",
                  "  pm.expect(res).to.have.property('job_id');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"repo_path\": \"{{repoPath}}\",\n  \"recreate\": false,\n  \"describe\": true\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/instances/pipeline",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["instances", "pipeline"]
            },
            "description": "Enqueue the ingestion pipeline. Returns { job_id, status } immediately and runs in the background.\n\nSet recreate:true only once, to migrate the schema (it drops the whole collection). The test script saves job_id into {{jobId}}.\n\ndescribe defaults to true. Set describe:false to opt out of per-entity LLM descriptions for this run -- this also skips the descriptor pre-flight below, and the summary named vector stays empty for this run's chunks.\n\nFail-loud descriptor policy (describe:true only): the configured DESC_MODEL/DESC_PROVIDER is checked before the job is created. Missing or unavailable descriptor -> 400, no job created (see the '400 - no descriptor model' saved example).\n\nPer-project job lock: a second pipeline/refresh/graph-only job for a project that already has one queued/running -> 409, no job created (see the '409 - job already running' saved example)."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "400 - no descriptor model",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"repo_path\": \"{{repoPath}}\",\n  \"recreate\": false\n}"
                },
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/instances/pipeline",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["instances", "pipeline"]
                }
              },
              "status": "Bad Request",
              "code": 400,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "cookie": [],
              "body": "{\n  \"detail\": \"no descriptor model specified — set DESC_MODEL (e.g. qwen2.5-coder:3b) or configure a remote provider via DESC_PROVIDER\"\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "409 - job already running",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"repo_path\": \"{{repoPath}}\",\n  \"recreate\": false\n}"
                },
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/instances/pipeline",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["instances", "pipeline"]
